      "full_page": "HIS 81 years OF \"TARFARE AGAINST THE ENEMIES OF OUR SOULS, THE UNBELIEVING WORLD, THE FLESH AND THE DEVIL - COMMON TO MANKIND - WERE CROWNED BY SEVERAL MONTES OF A PEACEFUL APPROACH TO A HAPPY DEATH. FOR THIS WE HAD PRAYED AND THIS WE DO CONFIDENTLY HOPE HIS DEATH WAS viz, A HAPPY TRANSISION TO THE HEAVEN-PROMISED ABODE WHERE GRATITUDE RIPEIS ITO PERFET LOVE OF GOD AND NEIGHBOR: AND WHERE ACCORDING TO ST. PAUL: \" .... EYE HATH NOT SEEET, EAR HATH NOT HEARD NOR HATH IT ENTERED INTO THE HEART OF MAN TO COCEIVE WHAT THINGS GOD HATH PREPARE FOR THEM THAT LOVE HIM. \"",
      "per_polygon": "HIS 81 years OF \"WARFARE AGAINST THE ENEMIES OF OUR SOULS, THE UNBELIEVING WORLD, THE FLESH AND THE DEVIL - COMMON TO MANKIND - WERE CROWNED BY SEVERAL MONTES OF A PEACEFUL APPROACH TO A HAPPY DEATH. FOR THIS WE HAD PRAYED AND THIS WE DO CONFIDENTLY HOPE HIS DEATH WAS viz, A HAPPY TRANSISION TO THE HEAVEN-PROMISED ABODE WHERE GRATITUDE RIPETS INTO PERFET LOVE OF GOD AND NEIGHBOR: AND WHERE ACCORDING TO ST. PAUL: \" .... EYE HATH NOT SEMET, EAR HATH NOT HEARD NOR HATH IT ENTERED INTO THE HEART OF MAN TO COCEIVE WHAT THINGS GOD HATH PREPARE FOR THEM THAT LOVE HIM. \"",
